| IBIS sample fixture for rfauto (tests/unit/fixtures/ibis/sample.ibs)
| Seat Q-X46 (aurora_q, 2026-11-07). Synthetic shape data -- NOT a real
| buffer. Covers: header keywords, component/manufacturer, package
| typ-min-max triples, pin table (GND/VDD/NC rows + R_pin/L_pin/C_pin),
| model selector, three models (Input with GND clamp only; Output with
| 3 IV tables + ramp + rising/falling waveforms; Output with pulldown
| and rising waveform only), and one unknown keyword ([OEM]) for the
| warning path. All numbers are fixture demonstration values.

